","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["公子高"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:p020","quote":"公子高欲奔，恐收族，乃上書曰：「先帝無恙時，臣入則賜食，出則乘輿。御府之衣，臣得賜之；中廄之寶馬，臣得賜之。臣當從死而不能，為人子不孝，為人臣不忠。不忠者無名以立於世，臣請從死，願葬酈山之足。唯上幸哀憐之。」書上，胡亥大說，召趙高而示之，曰：「此可謂急乎？」趙高曰：「人臣當憂死而不暇，何變之得謀！」胡亥可其書，賜錢十萬以葬。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:p020","text":"公子高欲奔，恐收族，乃上書曰：「先帝無恙時，臣入則賜食，出則乘輿。御府之衣，臣得賜之；中廄之寶馬，臣得賜之。臣當從死而不能，為人子不孝，為人臣不忠。不忠者無名以立於世，臣請從死，願葬酈山之足。唯上幸哀憐之。」書上，胡亥大說，召趙高而示之，曰：「此可謂急乎？」趙高曰：「人臣當憂死而不暇，何變之得謀！」胡亥可其書，賜錢十萬以葬。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m020-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"公子高","kind":"person","person_id":"172_ij7_8yf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m020-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"先帝","kind":"person","person_id":"z0a_bdl_gn5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m020-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"人臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或引古未定短稱保留未解，未補特定個人或世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m020-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"胡亥","kind":"person","person_id":"z0a_bdl_gn5_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m020-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"4ai_d4s_gde","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m020-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"趙高","kind":"person","person_id":"4ai_d4s_gde","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m020-0134","start":134,"end":136,"surface":"人臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱或引古未定短稱保留未解，未補特定個人或世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-087-lisi:m020-0150","start":150,"end":152,"surface":"胡亥","kind":"person","person_id":"z0a_bdl_gn5_B","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-087-lisi","book_id":"b-shiji-087","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-087-lisi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-087-lisi","work_